<div>Solution:&nbsp;</div>
<div>Let marked price be 100%.<br />&rArr; S.P = (90/100) &times; (80/100) &times; (75/100) &times; 100<br />&rArr; S.P = 54%<br /><br />Discount will be 100 &ndash; 54 = 46%<br /><br />&there4; The single discount will be 46%</div>
